# English-only code

All **scripts and source code** in this repo must be written in English:

- Comments and docstrings
- Log / print / error / argparse messages
- Hardcoded UI labels in CLI and Streamlit
- SQL schema/migration comments
- Commit messages (see commit-messages-en.mdc)

## Allowed French

- Game **content** columns (`*_fr`, `question_fr`, payload locale `fr`) and catalog blurbs for players
- Bilingual user docs (`README.md`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`) outside code

## Examples

```python
# Bad
print("Choisis ta filiale")
"""Évite les erreurs Unicode."""

# Good
print("Choose your subsidiary")
"""Avoid UnicodeEncodeError on Windows consoles (cp1252)."""
```

When editing code, translate any remaining French developer or UI strings to English.
